msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Perfil"

msgctxt "profile_text"
msgid ""
"What other people see of you in-world (the picture and the interests are set "
"in the viewer)."
msgstr ""
"O que os outros veem de você no mundo virtual (a foto e os interesses se "
"definem no viewer)."

